<p>You have learned to hit the right spot, increasing your armor penetration by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">10, 14, 18, 21, 24</acronym> when dual wielding.</p><p>The Armour penetration bonus will increase with your Dexterity.</p>